# OneOS package set lineage: sha256sum of out/overlays_lineage_r5 (LineageOS 24.0, OnePlus 15 infiniti nightly of 2026-11-11, CP2A.260605.016; r1 of 2026-11-13 from scripts/make-overlays.sh with the gvld pins for its vold and service.incremental.so), minus tethering_payload.img and cellbroadcast_payload.img (One UI's modules stay, as for Infinity-X). No gmssystem payload: One UI's Google apps are laid over the guest's product partition at session time (guest_google.sh FULL mode). 0.5.06 r2: r1 plus OneOSPixelDoze.apk (AOD), 2026-11-14. 0.5.07 r3: r2 plus libbootanimation_preapex_patched.so (boot animation on every panel), 2026-11-14. 0.5.07 r4: services_patched.jar with patches/guest_sp_migration_tolerant.py, 2026-11-14.
